window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>BDSM erotic romance with a happy ending! Georgia is broke, and she can't resist the ad in the paper: Women with low libido needed for sex theme park. Never mind that with her lusty appetites, she hardly qualifies. She needs money, and she'll do whatever it takes to get it. </p> <p>To pass the audition, all she has to do is pretend to sleep while the sexiest man she's ever seen uses her however he pleases. But one session with Billy, and she knows she can't get enough of him. </p> <p>Billy's got plenty of inventive ways to prepare Georgia for the job, and he seems to enjoy punishing her for screwing up. Perhaps Billy has his own agenda, and a few secrets of his own.... </p> <p>This is a convenient box set of the five-part series: <i>Sleeping Lady</i>, <i>Sleeping chez Sade</i>, <i>Wide Awake</i>, <i>Wide Open</i>, and <i>His Kiss</i>. </p>"; 
